:: day1ft_window_hub [nobr]
<h2>🪟 The Window</h2>
<p>The world in two columns. Male and female. You fit in neither.</p>

<<if not $d1ft_npc_window>>
<div class="interaction-card side">
  <h4>👂 Listen</h4>
  <p>The palace continues. Hammers, guards, children, a bread vendor's song   sorted, without meaning to be, into two categories you no longer belong to.</p>
  [[Listen → |day1ft_npc_window]]
</div>
<<else>>
  <p class="loc-flavor">A slice of sky. The bridge railing. The far palace wall. The sound of a world that doesn't know what you've become.</p>
<</if>>

